    "Keep the source moving with the brush between strokes; off starts every stroke at the source point" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "笔触之间让源点随画笔移动；关闭后每次笔触都从源点开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the subject clear of the haze; off, it's hazed by its own distance, so a figure far off is misted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使主体不受雾霾影响；关闭后主体会按自身距离受雾，远处的人像会被雾气笼罩"
          }
